Z||000000||2xsess||10-29-2000||01:42 PM||||I had a great time yesterday meeting some of the forum members in Jacksonville. I'm probably beating Robert to the punch here but. I got a few of the pics from his website. <BR>Here's a pic of mine<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/661259c0.jpg">  <BR>I won't say anything about the car to the left of it though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Here's Turbo86SE, one sweet ride!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/turbo86SE_1.jpg">  <P>And Williams sharp coupe<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Williams_coupe.jpg">  <P>My computer is acting up so I can't post anymore pics but go to <A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/index.htm</A>  to see the rest of Roberts pics<P><BR>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT<p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 11-02-2000).]||||reg||4
