Z||000004||RobertVol||10-29-2000||11:01 PM||||BTW ....For the guys that were not at Olsens when I FINALLY GOT MY CAR!<P>The manager there, wants us to come back down and and when we meet use their store!<P>They are planning the let use our cars for a car show with a radio stations there and food. I would like for us to even get a BETTER turnout for that! It will be in a few weeks to a month from now. I spoke with the Florida Times union and they will post it there also. So Joel HAS to bring the Turbo and a couple of ported out and V-8's would be nice! <P>Had a blast! It was nice meeting everyone<P>BroCar...Good luck with your car. Mine is back there to. I am getting the manifolds done. I hope yours does not have a Major problem! <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT 55k  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>||||reg||1
