Z||000025||beachbomb||11-07-2000||12:49 PM||||Hey Jeff, the Indy's coming along pretty good. Doing alot of little things to it right now. Always trying to find Indy specific parts!! TO ALL CLUB MEMBER(especially in the JAX area) there is a small junk yard near where i live, its on Bulls Bay road just off west Beaver street, anyway they currently have 2 fieros there(one is a 1984 se, complete except for the parts i just took off it, and the have a (i think) 1985 or 1986 se(has GT body) that still has alot of parts on it, this has the V-6 engine). I talked to the owner and once we have club buisniss cards he would like me to give him one, so he can possibly call us when fieros come in. This junk yard is off the beaten track a little bit so i figure thats why these two cars are not totally stripped yet. Later...Jim<BR>p.s. I'll trade my wife for a mint '84 Indy!!(haha!!)||||reg||6
