Z||000027||turbo86se||11-08-2000||09:37 PM||||Ok, I'll try this again!<BR>Thanks for looking out for me guys! A meeting in Savannah would be great! That's only 3 hours or so from me. It's official, I've seen it! The V6 and tranny are mounted to the cradle, almost ready to be installed in my 88 coupe! Maybe I'll drive that down to Savannah. Any objections?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Jim, did you get my email about the Indy? I've been having some problems with Webtv lately. Anyways, the Indy is $1000 firm, no less, I've tried! Body is poor, it's rear-ended, cracks by the windshield, bottoms of doors are rusted completely, front fascia is ready to fall off. Interior wasn't that bad though, here's another, with less miles (24K), hope this works.  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=5405885&p=20237259" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=5405885&p=20237259</A> <P>Keep in mind Myrtle Beach is a great place for a meeting too. We could have one in the Inlet Square Mall parking lot. PLENTY of room! ||||reg||10
